{"v":1,"id":"atreides/ending","ms":35889,"lines":["It is over, Commander. Arrakis is ours.","The Emperor has given up his throne, and he will","stand trial for the treachery he worked against us.","The Duke will govern here with justice. The spice","will flow, and those who harvest it will be paid.","The Ordos and the Harkonnen are gone from this world.","I take no joy in their fall, only in the peace.","Thank you. It has been an honour to serve with you."],"words":[[93,199,0,0,2],[279,465,0,3,5],[625,1157,0,6,10],[1316,2461,0,12,21],[3153,3924,0,23,30],[4031,4217,0,31,33],[4350,5385,0,34,38],[6012,6118,1,0,3],[6278,6703,1,4,11],[6756,6916,1,12,15],[6969,7209,1,16,21],[7288,7395,1,22,24],[7421,7607,1,25,28],[7714,8565,1,29,35],[8698,8778,1,37,40],[8804,8857,1,41,43],[8911,9017,1,44,48],[9070,9389,2,0,5],[9496,10028,2,6,11],[10107,10214,2,12,15],[10214,10294,2,16,19],[10373,11092,2,20,29],[11198,11278,2,30,32],[11384,11650,2,33,39],[11703,12155,2,40,47],[12288,12643,2,48,50],[13316,13395,3,0,3],[13475,13768,3,4,8],[13821,13954,3,9,13],[14007,14326,3,14,20],[14406,14938,3,21,25],[15018,15177,3,26,30],[15257,16222,3,31,38],[16869,16948,3,40,43],[17055,17587,3,44,49],[17640,17773,4,0,4],[17906,18571,4,5,9],[18730,18810,4,11,14],[18863,19156,4,15,20],[19182,19262,4,21,24],[19422,19980,4,25,32],[20033,20140,4,33,35],[20193,20299,4,36,40],[20353,20432,4,41,43],[20539,21201,4,44,48],[21844,21977,5,0,3],[22190,22695,5,4,9],[22775,22855,5,10,13],[22881,22935,5,14,17],[22988,23998,5,18,27],[24131,24185,5,28,31],[24318,24663,5,32,36],[24716,24876,5,37,41],[24929,25169,5,42,46],[25248,25925,5,47,52],[26603,26709,6,0,1],[26763,27029,6,2,6],[27082,27268,6,7,9],[27348,27747,6,10,13],[27800,27880,6,14,16],[27933,28092,6,17,22],[28199,28757,6,23,27],[28997,29289,6,29,33],[29342,29449,6,34,36],[29449,29529,6,37,40],[29608,30250,6,41,46],[30959,31384,7,0,5],[31491,31730,7,6,9],[32849,32929,7,11,13],[32982,33222,7,14,17],[33222,33461,7,18,22],[33514,33621,7,23,25],[33833,34206,7,26,32],